  <section class="summary" aria-labelledby="sum">
    <h2 id="sum">The 30 second version</h2>
    <div><span class="k">Problem</span><p>Each buyer has one question that stops the sale: the shade for a foundation, the size for a dress.</p></div>
    <div><span class="k">Decision</span><p>The proof for that question sits right where it comes up, never in a tab further down.</p></div>
    <div><span class="k">The one metric that matters</span><p>Wrong shade reports. If the matcher works, that line falls.</p></div>
